{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_00696","headline":"郊庙歌辞 德明兴圣庙乐章 送神 · 李舒","name":"郊庙歌辞 德明兴圣庙乐章 送神","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"元精回复，灵贶繁滋。\n风洒兰路，云摇桂旗。\n高丘缅邈，凉部逶迟。\n瞻望靡及，缠绵永思。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李舒","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_00696.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_00696","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}